               <div draggable="true" data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dExXmK fNpoDq">
                <p class="sc-kAkozD iOjmJ pf-caret-color-transparent pf-word-wrap-break-word" contenteditable="true" spellcheck="false" draggable="true" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Our centrally located Indiana roastery means orders arrive as quickly as possible, whether heading to the East Coast, West Coast, or somewhere in between. We offer UPS shipping options for Ground, 2-Day or Next Day. Your coffee products will be shipped after it is roasted and packaged (not necessarily the same day you order).&nbsp;</p>
